12. History of severe food or drug allergy, or known allergy to the investigational drug and its excipients;
13. Expected survival period is less than 3 months;
14. Pregnant, planning pregnancy or breastfeeding patients;
15. Suspected or confirmed history of alcohol or drug abuse;
16. Participated in other drug or device clinical trial within the 3 months prior to screening or are participating in a other clinical trial;
17. Other conditions, and the investigator assessed that participation in the study might increase the patient's risk or that participation in the study was deemed inappropriate by the investigator.

Inclusion Criteria:

1. Age of 18-75 years (inclusive), male or female;
